    "detailed_description": "Silver blue is a Boy Love visual novel game rating 15+ that containing mystery adventure fantasy content about Cyan's journey to find his missing master. The remaining clues lead him to a mysterious mountain, which seemingly related to his origin, and at the same time his forgotten memories start to come back.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2666Three love interests and their respective routes, with 10 different endings overall depends on your choices. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2666Around 200k words in content. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2666More than 40+ in-game Illustrations. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u266630+ original backgrounds. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u266620 original soundtracks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u26664 different title screen to unlock.",
